{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/c704ddc6b7eabf2132b620ab83530016.poster.avif?t=1774305945\" width=600 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/c704ddc6b7eabf2132b620ab83530016.webm?t=1774305945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/c704ddc6b7eabf2132b620ab83530016.mp4?t=1774305945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a beautifully illustrated world in <strong>Pigeon Hunter</strong>, a tranquil hidden object game. Each room is a hand-drawn work of art, filled with carefully placed objects which, as the player you must find to complete the level.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in the relaxing gameplay as you search for cleverly hidden objects and journey through the rooms and courtyard of a dreamlike dwelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/4a51c26a5cb4848234c622da5f693704.poster.avif?t=1774305945\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/4a51c26a5cb4848234c622da5f693704.webm?t=1774305945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917020/extras/4a51c26a5cb4848234c622da5f693704.mp4?t=1774305945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand drawn 2d backgrounds.</p></li><li><p cl